@node MAIN "Backup Vault 0.7.0 - Main Menu"
@toc MAIN
@{b}Backup Vault@{ub}
Version 0.7.0

A backup / restore / sync / verify utility for AmigaOS 3.x, with a MUI
graphical front end (BackupVault), a matching command-line tool
(Backup), and two headless companion tools still under active
development (BackupVaultDaemon, BackupVaultWebDaemon).

                    @{" Overview "               LINK OVERVIEW}
                    @{" Features "               LINK FEATURES}
                    @{" Developer "              LINK DEVELOPER}
                    @{" Version history "        LINK VERSIONHISTORY}
                    @{" Requirements "           LINK REQUIREMENTS}
                    @{" Installation "           LINK INSTALL}
                    @{" Programs in this package " LINK PROGRAMS}

                    @{" The Backup tab "         LINK BACKUPTAB}
                    @{" Repositories "           LINK REPOSITORIES}
                    @{" Credentials "            LINK CREDENTIALS}
